RAILS (the standing unattended contract). Stay on the work branch; never checkout or merge
develop. NO CLOUD WRITES and no live calls — tests and local measurement only. Commit only on
a GREEN check, exit codes captured in variables and never read through a pipe. Explicit
pathspec (`git commit -- <paths>`), never bare `git commit` or `-a`. `Backlog: PL-50` trailer.
No attribution trailers. If blocked, record what you learned and stop — do not force it.

CHECK before each commit: the suites you touched, `npx tsc --noEmit`, `npm run
